y which lines up with  what we know the newman to be  descendants of denizens of another world  so clearly he is talking about the  newman thing is he claims that the  newman are from the eternal city as you  probably remember from playing the game  there are three eternal cities called  nochron noxtella and one that's unnamed  and they're each located far beneath the  ground but is that far enough down to be  considered outside the lands between a  different world i mean it's definitely a  long way down that's for sure it's  debatable but there is some soft proof  that it is to be considered outside the  lens between if we read the map  description for either the einzel or co  for rivers it states that the great  rivers flow beneath the lands between  which given their depth and great nature  could be interpreted as being outside  the lands between there's also the fact  that the entire lake of rot is down here  which is said to literally house the  essence of an outer god also known as  the scarlet rot and the fact that the  mogwin palace is down here that's  supposed to be the capital of moog's  dynasty in service to another outer god  called the formless mother combine the  presence of these other outer gods that  are not the greater will the  descriptions of the great rivers the  fact that multiple newman's runes can be  found down here and to the fact that the  black knife assassins are said to be  newmans who come from both the eternal  city and another world and you're left  with the probability that the lands  underneath the lands between are in fact  considered another world i mean there  are even actual stars hanging in the sky  down here so clearly there's something  weird going on anyway if the newman and  therefore america herself came from the  lands underneath the lands between that  opens up a whole can of worms because  you know what the eternal cities were  known and destroyed for defiance of the  greater will the civilizations that  lived down th