iving but  right about now you're probably thinking  to yourself what about the other newman  women the black knife assassins since we  know that they are closely related to  queen america and are of the same stock  doesn't that then imply that merica and  the black knife assassins are on the  same side and that she probably  orchestrated their plot but if she did  set the knight of the black knives in  motion then why would she have them kill  her son godwin the firstborn and  favorite of america the one whose death  was kind of a big deal that is a great  question and of course not one that can  be answered without a bit more  theorizing but hey why stop now see like  vati said in his video there are several  reasons to believe that america actually  orchestrated the knight of the black  knives one of the biggest reasons is of  course that she is a newman just like  the black knife assassins which is  already a super huge connection but  another reason is that her shadow  malaketh was said to have been betrayed  by her now i always thought this was  weird like how was america supposed to  have betrayed malekith when all she  really had him do was defeat the glomide  queen and her can apostles then keep a  watch over the rune of death was that  supposed to be her betrayal just asking  him to do that i'm not really seeing  much betrayal here except for i guess  the fact that malekith becomes addicted  to eating death root but that doesn't  make a lot of sense because he wasn't  like that until he embedded the rune of  death within his own body which didn't  happen until after it was stolen from  him on the night of the black knives  ah-ha light bulb see while i was  puzzling over this notion of america's  betrayal lo and behold a savior a timely  prometheus of lore descended upon my  twitter dms sharing their take on this  very subject with me who they called  their favorite lore person on youtube i  know i'm not going to cry anyway roxaff  pointed out that if you kill malaketh as  garak the beast clergyman he will ask  marika why she would gull him why she  would shatter before passing away and  not finishing his sentence don't you  hate when people die before finishing  their sentences so annoying the word  goal by the way means to deceive so  again we have proof that malekith was  deceived or betrayed by america but how  well like roxaff points out what if the  betrayal was the theft of the rune of  death see in my previous videos i've  stated over and over that i believe  marika was the one who removed the rune  of death aka destined death from the  elden ring spawning the golden order  like any it tells us and this is still  true i think but it was most likely not  something america did of her own  volition roxaff brought up the fact that  this logically has to be the case  because if america removed destin death  against the greater will's will then why  should they not permit its return and he  tells us straight up that the fingers in  greater will itself would not allow its  return meaning that the greater will  most likely commanded america to remove  death from the elden ring in order to  ensure that the reign via the elden  beast inside america was eternal in  order to allow the greater will to rule  over the lands between forever and this  is what created the golden order that we  know of today back to malakith though if  merika had him take the rune of death  but then orchestrated its theft for the  black knives which then led to malekith  destroying his own mind over embedding  the rune of death inside his very body  then that could be considered deceit or  betrayal either that or she betrayed him  by shattering the elden ring and turning  against the golden order but it just  feels strange to single out malekith as  the only person she betrayed in that  case either way though it does seem very  likely that america masterminded the  stealing of the rune of death in order  to combine it with her other initiative  