 the women of newman and their  significance in the story as a whole but  what did you guys think are the newman  women from the eternal cities below and  did they really betray america by  following ronnie's orders to assassinate  godwin or is this all just a bunch of  baseless speculation and the women of  newman really are just aliens from  another planet let me know in the  comments below also thank you so much  for watching if you enjoyed it or at  least my efforts into making it please  consider leaving a like on the video as  these videos take lots of time and brain  power to put together and subscribe if  you haven't already for many more lore  videos to come huge thanks as always to  my bandit crew of which i have the  fabulous xander bee to welcome into the  fold that's all i've got for this one so  as always i hope you have a wonderful  rest of your day this is bandit looking  forward to seeing you next time and  signing out peace  [Music]  you

